# EcoVision Mobile - Project Rules

## Project Overview
EcoVision Mobile là ứng dụng Flutter theo dõi chất lượng không khí (AQI) và tìm lộ trình di chuyển thông minh.

## Architecture
- **Pattern**: Clean Architecture với Feature-First structure
- **State Management**: Flutter Riverpod
- **Language**: Dart (code in English, comments in Vietnamese)

## Project Structure
```
lib/
├── core/              # Shared code (theme, colors, text styles)
├── common/            # Shared widgets (bottom nav, etc.)
├── features/          # Feature modules
│   ├── auth/         # Authentication
│   ├── home/         # Home screen with AQI data
│   ├── map/          # Map with route planning
│   ├── report/       # Pollution reporting
│   ├── chat/         # AI chat assistant
│   └── profile/      # User profile
├── routing/          # Navigation
└── main.dart         # Entry point
```

## Feature Structure (Clean Architecture)
Each feature follows this structure:
```
features/[feature_name]/
├── data/
│   ├── models/          # Data models (JSON serialization)
│   ├── services/        # API services (HTTP calls)
│   └── repositories/    # Business logic + caching
├── domain/
│   └── models/          # Domain models (UI models)
└── presentation/
    ├── pages/           # Screens
    ├── widgets/         # UI components
    └── providers/       # State management (Riverpod)
```

## Data Flow
```
UI (Widget) → Provider (Riverpod) → Repository → Service → API
```

## Coding Standards
1. **Code Language**: Always write code in English
2. **Comments**: Can use Vietnamese for comments
3. **Naming**: Use descriptive English names
4. **State Management**: Use Riverpod providers
5. **Error Handling**: Always handle errors gracefully with fallbacks

## Dependencies
- flutter_riverpod: State management
- google_fonts: Custom fonts (Inter)
- flutter_map: OpenStreetMap integration
- geolocator: Location services
- geocoding: Address geocoding
- permission_handler: Permissions
- fl_chart: Charts
- image_picker: Image selection
- http: HTTP requests
- shared_preferences: Local storage

## Current Status
- ✅ Home page with AQI data (using AQICN API)
- ✅ Map page with OpenStreetMap (free, no API key)
- ✅ Report page (mock data)
- ✅ Chat page (mock responses)
- ✅ Profile page (mock data)
- ⚠️ Authentication page exists but not integrated
- ⚠️ Most features use mock data, waiting for backend API

## API Integration
- Currently using AQICN API for AQI data
- Backend API guide: See BACKEND_API_GUIDE.md
- Cache strategy: 15 minutes for AQI data

## Important Notes
- Location fallback: Da Nang, Vietnam (16.0544, 108.2022)
- Cache duration: 15 minutes for AQI
- Map: Using OpenStreetMap (free alternative to Google Maps)
- Mock data: Used for Chat, Report, Profile features

